text":"古人都把这东西放户外用吗？ https://t.co/s5elmi1XLZ","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2022266590188736579"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-13T06:33:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2022197321518444827"],"id":"2022197321518444827","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13114,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2022197252333380059","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"我并不怪父母，我初中学习就不好，连高中都没考上，后来花钱读的民办学校，再后来因为我脑子有问题和网恋对象奔现搓学了，当初没钱就和父母要，始终没有体会过挣钱的辛苦，确实钱难挣屎难吃，我不怪她们，只希望大家好好学习不要像我，天下没有后悔药","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2022197321518444827"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-13T06:32:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2022197252333380059"],"id":"2022197252333380059","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":17934,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我后悔搓学了，前段时间和爸妈商量想在回去读书，她们说有供我读一个大专的钱，等我毕业多久才能挣回来？而且我哥还没娶媳妇，家里也不富裕，让我就在家和他们开卤肉店吧","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2022197252333380059"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-13T03:53:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2022157236500676690"],"id":"2022157236500676690","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11874,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2022157088101970005","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"问过两次了，几个月前问我我就拒绝了，最近又问一次，我还是耐心的回复了不处，结果就被骂了，想不明白不处对象是得罪你了吗？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2022157236500676690"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-02-13T03:53:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2022157088101970005"],"id":"2022157088101970005","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28117,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我不想处对象也犯法吗？🥺 https://t.co/Iq5Dw05PuK","url":"h